  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/tarball/v0.9.10",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/zipball/v0.9.10",
  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.9.10\n\nReleased on 2026-11-04.\n\n`hyperframes billing` now shows the price and pays from the terminal on Enter, and `billing add-credits` replaces `billing top-up`. Templates pull no longer counts an empty folder or a stray file as an installed template, and media-use sends pictures without ffmpeg.\n\n## Features\n\n- **CLI:** Billing and upgrade links carry the signed-in workspace ([c5a5e0882](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/c5a5e08827d5b184a7b608ff50034a618c4d9829), [#7103](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7103)).\n- **CLI:** Billing top-up is renamed to add-credits with no alias ([d21877eb2](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/d21877eb20b0a22588fb6cd5c024438bafc0bb89), [#7121](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7121)).\n- **CLI:** Billing shows the price and pays from the terminal on Enter ([87a42e747](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/87a42e7470c28aa689934a28a0a53784459b99f2), [#7068](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7068)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **CLI:** Check skill freshness at the install destination ([b02fe6506](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/b02fe6506e476d41f3bd924ae5248fa26381d720), [#7120](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7120)).\n- **CLI:** Check ignores the cancelled fetch of a proxy-swapped media file, not a broken image ([e46ecd850](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/e46ecd850ec49fb2d97d8e4cca71ab30dc1849e2), [#6928](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6928)).\n- **CLI:** Check waits for the composition as long as snapshot and render do ([f487a20b2](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/f487a20b28ae83afdff2892852f26bb8c0e6bc86), [#6947](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6947)).\n- **CLI:** Media-use sends a picture on a machine with no ffmpeg ([3adc9f130](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/3adc9f130d907f37c16fdefcc30b27abc142287d), [#7112](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7112)).\n- **CLI:** The FFmpeg cannot-start error names the OS error code or signal ([482bcd73e](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/482bcd73ed5496724eb9ff6a69c8f2b085c35efa), [#7115](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7115)).\n- **CLI:** Templates pull reuses only a template it pulled, not any path in the way ([d88d2cce4](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/d88d2cce4b1d4ec54a182b84d7a217eb2a6e640a), [#7116](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7116)).\n- **Producer:** A laptop that sleeps mid-render no longer counts the sleep as a capture stall ([e2edc93f5](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/e2edc93f5f4127fd44d4fcfd6534db7bb0d8d4aa), [#7096](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7096)).\n- **Producer:** A stalled capture resumes at the first unwritten frame, not frame 0 ([3dc82f18e](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/3dc82f18e3f99350f9a0c0f1738bcee8d1e44741), [#7104](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7104)).\n- **Check:** The analysis restarts the idle window with every call it makes ([3aaed65ef](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/3aaed65ef6c3b0f1bea16eab566bee11ddaf5b06), [#6919](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6919)).\n- **CLI:** Don't invent a purchase link when the server withholds upgrade_url ([a5a612133](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/a5a61213320c523875633a94ef96097456269136), [#7031](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7031)).\n\n## Performance\n\n- **Studio:** A long film's media durations write the store once per file, not once per clip ([3a28ef41a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/3a28ef41aeb68c43cccdf7f963e19ea8d6feb36a), [#6745](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6745)).\n\n## Docs & Examples\n\n- **Skills:** Reverse-any-video runs sign-in and payment itself and opens the result ([341fdd353](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/com